    <shape type="text" topLeftX="42" topLeftY="178" width="426" height="40">
      <content fontSize="13.5" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="center">
        <p><formula><latex><![CDATA[g_{ij}=\mathrm{MLP}_{e}([\mathrm{hops}_{ij},\ell_{ij},\mathrm{ord}_{j},A_{j},s_{j}])]]></latex></formula></p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="42" topLeftY="228" width="426" height="28">
      <content fontSize="13.5" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="center">
        <p><formula><latex><![CDATA[m_i=\sum_{j}g_{ij}W_{j\to i}h_j]]></latex></formula></p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="42" topLeftY="256" width="426" height="16">
      <content fontSize="9.5" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(122, 116, 106, 1)" textAlign="center">
        <p>j 取遍上游邻域 N(i)，W_{j→i} 为方向权重</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="494" topLeftY="178" width="418" height="40">
      <content fontSize="13.5" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="center">
        <p><formula><latex><![CDATA[e_i=\mathrm{MLP}_{c}([\mathrm{land}_i,\mathrm{clim}_i,\mathrm{soil}_i,\mathrm{hydro}_i])]]></latex></formula></p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="494" topLeftY="228" width="418" height="40">
      <content fontSize="13.5" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="center">
        <p><formula><latex><![CDATA[h_i^{0}=[x_i\Vert e_i]]></latex></formula></p>
      </content>
    </shape>
  </data>
